T:Splinter Mcleod's Waltz
% NFF Book 2023
S:collected from Norm McConnell, Echlin South, Vic
S:collected by John Meredith
H:This tune is an adaption of the melody in Splinter McCloud's Jig, 
H:a tune learnt from Scottish piper and drummer 'Splinter' McLeod, 
H:at Noorat sometime in the 1920s.  The original is undiscovered as yet,
H:however, the tune appears in an audio visual as 
H:"La Valse Du Mariage",  Guidry Brothers, 1929.
F:https://catalogue.nla.gov.au/Record/2066986
